{%- comment -%} Theme-editor-only reminder when a form section has no action URL. Accepts: action {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.design_mode and action == blank -%}
  <p class="avm-form-notice">
    Editor note (not shown to visitors): set "Form action URL" in this section's settings. Until then, submissions show the error message.
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
